quran[24]{c,v,t}:
  53,45,"and that He creates the two genders, male and female,"
  53,46,from a fertilised egg (i.e. a zygote*) when settled (into the mother’s womb).
  53,47,And it is upon Him to bring out the second genesis.
  53,48,And that He is the One Who enriches and grants possessions.
  53,49,And that He is the One Who is the Lord of Sirius (i.e. a star worshipped by some ancient pagans).
  53,50,"And that He is the One Who destroyed the first (people of) ‘Ad,"
  53,51,"then (the people of) Thamud, sparing none (of them),"
  53,52,"and the people of Nuh (Noah) before (all of them). Indeed, they were most unjust and rebellious."
  53,53,"And He smashed the towns (of Sodom and Gomorrah), turning (them) upside down."
  53,54,So whatever fell on them covered them completely.
  53,55,Then which of your Lord’s blessings will you dispute?
  53,56,This (Esteemed Prophet (blessings and peace be upon him) is a Warner (in the tradition) of the earlier warners.
  53,57,The imminent (Hour) has drawn near.
  53,58,None can disclose it besides Allah.
  53,59,"Do you then wonder at this (revealed) discourse,"
  53,60,"and laugh (at it) and not weep (in fear),"
  53,61,and you remain heedless?
  53,62,"Instead, prostrate to Allah and worship (Him)."
  54,1,"The Last Hour has drawn near, and the moon was split (in two)."
  54,2,"If they (the disbelievers) see a (miraculous) sign, they turn away and say: ‘(This is) the same (old) magic.’"
  54,3,"They reject (the truth) and follow their desires. So, every matter has an appropriate setting."
  54,4,"Indeed, the reports (of destroyed nations) that contain (sufficient) deterrents have already come to them."
  54,5,"(There is) far-reaching wisdom (in these reports), but warnings are of no benefit (to them)."
  54,6,"So, turn away from them (and wait for) the Day when the caller (angel) calls them to something horrible."
